    "description": "<p>A series of low strikes at an opponent's lower body with the intent to ruin their legs. Make 2 melee taijutsu Attacks at a target creature in range. On a hit, you deal your [Weapon damage]. If you hit a creature twice with this jutsu, they are knocked Prone.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: Affected creatures that is knocked Prone from this jutsu must spend its full movement to stand up.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For every rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost by 3 and the damage by 1d6.</p>",
